m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781590/extras/9dd74906245ddf017b832353eb5b1490.avif?t=1667490733\" width=624 height=150 /></span><br><br>Permanently unlock classes, recipes, and more through encounters and treasure rewards.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781590/extras/ede99666868b6d7a2c2b36f8ec6c27e0.avif?t=1667490733\" width=624 height=150 /></span><br><br>Every playthrough features new heroes, along with new enemies to defeat, encounters to discover, and treasure to find<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781590/extras/94525d196b61311cce7544b3da5ec23f.avif?t=1667490733\" width=624 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Role-Playing </h2><br>Earn experience and customize your hero's skills and talents.  Add to their repertoir by discovering skill books and manuals throughout the world. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781590/extras/fe3c543def055873d003159c959aa7a7.avif?t=1667490733\" width=624 height=150 /></span><br><br>Use what you find or keep it to craft or sell.  Every item has value.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781590/extras/2d15ca83aa0428a681fbaf4f24186a7c.avif?t=1667490733\" width=624 height=150 /></span><br><br>The choices you make can change the outcome of every encounter, along with randomized results to make every playthrough different.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781590/extras/980304eee596bbb1d81aa079ac799391.avif?t=1667490733\" width=624 height=150 /></span>", "short_description": "Recruit a company of heroes to save a world in ruins after a devastating cataclysm. Valley Knights 